		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:derdua4mnjknb3t5pskwbqx3/app.bsky.feed.post/3lusjl5cvzc2f",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/dwkns.bsky.social/post/3lusjl5cvzc2f",
			"author": {
				"name": "dwkns.bsky.social",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/dwkns.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:derdua4mnjknb3t5pskwbqx3/bafkreiczi2whi5yh5zef6lq4bjyj2kbhsznbee5e533wk4lfpjv2pihvqu"
			},
			"date": "2025-07-25T17:00:48.385Z",
			"content": "<p>\"As an aside, this search has made me tempted to ask: do we need to keep Dual publishing packages? I prefer ESM over CJS but maybe just pick one?\"</p>\n<p>Could this mean you'll drop support for CJS config in Eleventy v4? Would mean we wouldn't have to Dual publish plugins.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lusm3opvos2o",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:derdua4mnjknb3t5pskwbqx3/app.bsky.feed.post/3lusjl5cvzc2f",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lusm3opvos2o",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-07-25T17:45:50.992Z",
			"content": "<p>naw, there’s no reason to drop CJS config/data/template file support in Eleventy. It’s written in ESM but works with CJS (in Node 18 too)</p>\n<p>None of the official Eleventy plugins are dual published either, fwiw — if they need to support core &lt; 3, they’ll stay as CJS. If core &gt;=3, they can be ESM-only</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lusm4ynv2c2o",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lusm3opvos2o",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3lusm4ynv2c2o",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-07-25T17:46:34.966Z",
			"content": "<p>to be clear, CJS configs can import ESM plugins with `await import`</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ragnyp2umnktcv2krif4lhvs/app.bsky.feed.post/3lusn6khu2k2q",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mxdvl.com/post/3lusn6khu2k2q",
			"author": {
