				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-07-25T18:08:44.044Z",
			"content": "<p>I would say not very open to readability tradeoffs but also you’re right — the error messaging here is not specific: just invalid or valid</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
